pageheading(d,'Feature equations and provenance');d.add_paragraph('For article i, a(i) is publication time rounded up to the next hour. At hourly origin t, the direct inputs are unweighted means of sentiment, XRP specificity, XRP stance and uncertainty for articles in (t−1 hour,t], plus news presence and hours since the latest eligible article capped at 48. Empty means are zero; presence distinguishes an empty archive hour from observed neutral news. No price movement is used to score or timestamp news.')
equation(d,'direct_k(t) = mean{x(i,k) : t−1 < a(i) ≤ t}');equation(d,'presence(t) = 1[n(t)>0]; age(t) = min(48, t−max a(i))');d.add_paragraph('The equation uses articles in the trailing interval [t−48 hours,t]. With sentiment s(i), specificity q(i), half-life h=6 hours and epsilon=10⁻⁹, its two inputs are:');equation(d,'w(i,t) = q(i) exp(−ln(2) (t−a(i))/6)');equation(d,'N(t) = Σw(i,t)s(i) / (10⁻⁹ + Σw(i,t))');equation(d,'no_relevant_news(t) = 1[Σw(i,t)=0]');d.add_paragraph('This normalized average does not halve the amplitude of a lone article as it ages; weights alter relative contributions until the 48-hour cutoff removes articles. The equation is a proposed research feature, not an observed price-impact measure.');equation(d,'r(t,24) = ln(P(t+24)/P(t)); P̂(t+24) = P(t) exp(r̂(t,24))');d.add_heading('Technical input schema',1);d.add_paragraph(', '.join(json.loads((P/'E3/CONFIG.json').read_text())['features'][:19])+'.');d.add_heading('Coverage and interpretation limits',1);d.add_paragraph(limits);d.add_paragraph('E3 adds potentially redundant summaries of the same archive. Redundancy or optimisation variability could explain the lack of improvement, but neither mechanism is established by these results. Combining features does not guarantee new predictive information.')
